(148, 'Sci-Fi / Thriller', 50000, 'A thief who steals corporate secrets through the use of dream-sharing technology is given the inverse task of planting an idea.', 'INCEPTION', 'https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BMjAxMzY3NjcxNF5BMl5BanBnXkFtZTcwNTI5OTM0Mw@@._V1_.jpg', 'Now Showing'),
